P15004","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1020705","horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10115","name":{"zh":"征讨南蛮","en":"Southern Campaign"},"year":"225","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1031","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[62,61,60,65,66,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15004","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1020705","horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1031","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[62,61,60,65,66,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15004","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1020705","horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1031","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[62,61,60,65,66,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15004","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1020705","horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1031","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[62,61,60,65,66,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15004","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1020705","horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1031","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[62,61,60,65,66,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15004","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1020705","horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1031","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[62,61,60,65,66,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15004","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1020705","horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1031","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[62,61,60,65,66,78],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15004","armor":"WP1009005","helmet":"WP1020705","horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"安定朝那（今宁夏彭阳）人，东汉名将皇甫嵩之子。少年时与董卓相交深厚，初平元年，董卓掌权后记恨旧怨，征召皇甫嵩入京下狱，准备处死。皇甫坚寿自长安奔洛阳，恰逢董卓大宴宾客，径直上前当众责以大义、叩头痛哭，言辞恳切。满座宾客皆动容离席求情，董卓忌惮天下舆论，最终释放皇甫嵩，复授议郎、御史中丞。董卓伏诛后，朝廷征召其为侍中，坚寿看透乱世朝堂凶险，坚决推辞不就职，后因病在家终老。","tc":"安定朝那（今寧夏彭陽）人，東漢名將皇甫嵩之子。少年時與董卓相交深厚，初平元年，董卓掌權后記恨舊怨，征召皇甫嵩入京下獄，準備處死。皇甫堅壽自長安奔洛陽，恰逢董卓大宴賓客，徑直上前當眾責以大義、叩頭痛哭，言辭懇切。滿座賓客皆動容離席求情，董卓忌憚天下輿論，最終釋放皇甫嵩，復授議郎、御史中丞。董卓伏誅后，朝廷征召其為侍中，堅壽看透亂世朝堂兇險，堅決推辭不就職，后因病在家終老。","en":"A native of Chaona in Anding (present-day Pengyang, Ningxia) and the son of the famous Eastern Han general Huangfu Song. In his youth, he had a close friendship with Dong Zhuo. In the 1st year of Chuping, after Dong Zhuo seized power, he harbored an old grudge and summoned Huangfu Song to the capital, throwing him into prison with intent to execute him. Huangfu Jianshou rushed from Chang'an to Luoyang, arriving just as Dong Zhuo was hosting a grand banquet. He stepped forward directly in front of the assembly to admonish Dong Zhuo with moral righteousness, kowtowing and weeping bitterly with heartfelt eloquence. Moved by his sincerity, the entire assembly of guests rose to plead for leniency. Dong Zhuo, wary of public condemnation across the realm, ultimately released Huangfu Song and reappointed him as Consultant and Palace Assistant Imperial Clerk. After Dong Zhuo was slain, the imperial court summoned Jianshou to serve as Palace Attendant. Having seen through the perils of the court during turbulent times, Jianshou resolutely declined the post and later died of illness at home in his old age.","jp":"安定郡朝那県（現在の寧夏彭陽県）の人。後漢の名将・皇甫嵩の子。少年の頃より董卓と親交が深かった。初平元年、権力を掌握した董卓が旧怨から皇甫嵩を都へ召し出して投獄し、処刑しようとした。皇甫堅寿は長安から洛陽へと駆けつけたが、ちょうど董卓が賓客を集めて盛大な宴を催している最中であった。堅寿は直ちに進み出て衆前で大義を説いて董卓を責め、頭を打ち付けて号泣し、切々と訴えた。満座の客もみな胸を打たれて席を立って助命を請い、董卓も世論を憚ってついに皇甫嵩を釈放し、再び議郎や御史中丞に任じた。董卓が誅殺された後、朝廷から侍中として召し出されたが、堅寿は乱世の朝廷の険悪さを見抜いて固辞し、のちに病のため自宅で生涯を終えた。","kr":"안정군 조나현(지금의 영하 팽양) 사람으로, 동한의 명장 황보숭의 아들이다. 젊은 시절 동탁과 교분이 두터웠으나, 초평 원년 권력을 장악한 동탁이 옛 원한을 품고 황보숭을 도성으로 불러들여 옥에 가둔 뒤 처형하려 했다. 이에 황보견수가 장안에서 낙양으로 달려갔는데, 마침 동탁이 손님들을 모아 성대한 연회를 열고 있었다. 견수는 곧장 앞으로 나아가 사람들 앞에서 대의를 들어 꾸짖으며 머리를 조아려 통곡하니, 그 언사가 몹시 간곡하였다. 좌중의 손님들이 모두 감동하여 자리에서 일어나 선처를 청하자, 동탁도 천하의 여론을 꺼려 결국 황보숭을 석방하고 다시 의랑과 어사중승을 제수했다. 동탁이 주살된 후 조정에서 시중으로 불렀으나, 견수는 난세 조정의 험난함을 꿰뚫어 보고 결단코 사양하며 취임하지 않았고, 이후 병으로 집에서 여생을 마쳤다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1030115","remark":"普武","surname":"皇甫","surnameTc":"皇甫","surnameEn":"Huangfu","surnameJp":"皇甫","surnameKr":"황보","surnameOther":"","name":"坚寿","nameTc":"堅壽","nameEn":"Jianshou","nameJp":"堅寿","nameKr":"견수","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"皇甫坚寿","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"190","city":"CS1031","gender":"0","rule":"62","force":"61","wise":"60","politics":"65","charm":"66","will":"78","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"66/60/17/17/17/24/11/35","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1004502","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"3600","battleSoulP